  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.4: faster lossless (Modular) decoding with identical output: branch-free weighted predictor, prefix-code rows with the bit buffer in locals, vectorized integer pixel output. Lossless decoding 1.2-1.9x faster than 0.8.3 on one thread, lossless encoding up to 1.5x faster (same bytes). No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.4.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
